'''Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals''' (電脳学園ギャラクシーギャルズ dennou gakuen gyarakushī gyaruzu) is the third [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] unlocked in [[The Battle Cats POP!]] A feature unique with the Nintendo 3DS version is that [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]] and [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Units]] are unlocked over time thus expanding the regular pool of the game. To unlock this banner, it requires beating [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] of Chapter 2.

